  <text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
    <body>

        <div xml:id="AN203.1-kilavi">
          <p type="edition"><anchor n="1"/>makaṭpōkkiya cevuli colliyatu.
          </p>
          <p type="translation" xml:lang="en">What is said by the foster mother who had let [her] daughter go.</p>
        </div>
        <div rend="parallel">
      <lg xml:id="AN203.1">
        <l>uvakku<supplied>na</supplied> ḷāyiṉu muṭalu<supplied>na</supplied> ḷāyiṉu<supplied>n</supplied></l>
        <l>tāyaṟin tuṇarka veṉṉār tīvā</l>
        <l>yalarviṉai mēva lampaṟ peṇṭi</l>
        <l>riṉṉa ḷiṉaiyaṇiṉ makaḷeṉap paṉṉā<anchor n="2"/></l>
        <l>ḷeṉakkuvan turaippavun taṉakkuraip paṟiyē</l>
        <l>ṉāṇuva ḷivaḷeṉa<anchor n="3"/> naṉikaran tuṟaiyum</l>
        <l>yāṉiv vaṟumaṉai yoḻiyat tāṉē</l>
        <l>yaṉṉai yaṟiyi ṉivaḷuṟai vāḻkkai</l>
        <l>yeṉakkeḷi tāka lilleṉa kaḻaṟkāṉ</l>
        <l>miṉṉoḷir neṭuvē liḷaiyōṉ muṉṉuṟap</l>
        <l>paṉmalai yaruñcuram pōkiya taṉakkiyā</l>
        <l>ṉaṉṉē ṉaṉmai naṉvā yāka</l>
        <l>mātar mayaṅkiya malaimutaṟ ciṟuneṟi</l>
        <l>veytiṭai yaṟāa teyti muṉṉarp</l>
        <l><anchor n="4"/>pulleṉ mālaip pulampukoḷ cīṟūrc</l>
        <l>celvirun tāṟṟit tucci lirukka</l>
        <l>nuṉaikuḻait talamaru no<supplied>cci</supplied></l>
        <l>maṉaiceḻum peṇṭiyā ṉākuka maṉṉē.</l>
      </lg>
      <lg type="translation" xml:lang="en">
        <l>While , not saying “whether she will rejoice</l>
        <l corresp="1f">or be enraged, let the mother know [and] understand”, evil-mouthed</l>
        <l>rumour[-spreading] women being attached to the work of gossip</l>
        <l>come to me for many days [and] talk:</l>
        <l corresp="3-5">“like this, of this kind [is] your daughter!” I don’t know what to say for her.</l>
        <l>While I</l>
        <l>from whom [she] kept hiding [it], thinking “she would be ashamed”</l>
        <l rend="indent2" corresp="6f">stay behind in the empty house, she herself,</l>
        <l>thinking “if mother knows, living where she stays</l>
        <l corresp="8-9c">will not be easy for me”,</l>
        <l>has gone  to the difficult desert with many mountains,</l>
        <l>having before [her] a youth with a glitter-flashing long spear [and] ankleted feet,</l>
        <l corresp="9c-11">for the sake of her [who has done so],</l>
        <l corresp="12">the good truth being that it is not the case that I am like that,</l>
        <l>let me reach before [them] without stopping in the middle of the small path</l>
        <l corresp="13f">that is hot at the foot of the mountains where women are confounded;</l>
        <l>let me comfort [them as] guests who go to a lonely little village</l>
        <l corresp="15f">in bleak evening, so that they sit in the shelter;</l>
        <l corresp="18">let me be the wealthy woman of the house</l>
        <l corresp="17">by the Nocci tree whose tips sprout in a riot [of colour].</l>
      </lg>
        </div>
    </body>
  </text>

